@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam state {
  FontSize 11
  AttributeFontSize 10
}

title Garden Watering State Machine\n3-Second Batches with Delayed OFF Messages

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE : Output: "IDLE"
IDLE : System ready
IDLE : Display: "Ready"

note right of IDLE
  Triggered by:
  - Sunset -2hrs
  - Sunrise +1hrs
  
  Available data:
  - predicted_rain_mm
  - base_seconds per plant
  - soil_moisture (optional)
end note

IDLE --> CALCULATE : Watering trigger

CALCULATE : Output: "CALCULATE"
CALCULATE : rain_factor = 1 - (rain_mm/10)
CALCULATE : p1_batches = ceil(p1_base * rain_factor / 3)
CALCULATE : p2_batches = ceil(p2_base * rain_factor / 3)
CALCULATE : etc...
CALCULATE : Display: "Calculating..."
CALCULATE : → Next state in same action

CALCULATE --> SKIP_ALL : All plants have 0 batches
CALCULATE --> START_SEQUENCE : Need water

SKIP_ALL : Output: "SKIP_ALL"
SKIP_ALL : Display: "Skipped - Rain"
SKIP_ALL : NeoPixel: Green
SKIP_ALL --> IDLE

START_SEQUENCE : Output: "START_SEQUENCE"
START_SEQUENCE : Pump ON (immediate)
START_SEQUENCE : Display: "Starting pump"
START_SEQUENCE : NeoPixel: Blue
START_SEQUENCE : → Next state in same action

START_SEQUENCE --> P1_BATCH_1 : p1_batches > 0
START_SEQUENCE --> P2_BATCH_1 : p1_batches = 0

note right of P1_BATCH_1
  Plant 1 Watering:
  Each batch = 3 seconds
  
  Single action publishes:
  1. Solenoid ON (immediate)
  2. Solenoid OFF (3s delay)
  3. State update (immediate)
end note

P1_BATCH_1 : Output: "P1_BATCH_1"
P1_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 0 ON (immediate)
P1_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 0 OFF (3s delay)
P1_BATCH_1 : Display: "Plant 1: 1/{p1_batches}"
P1_BATCH_1 : batches_done = 1

P1_BATCH_1 --> P1_BATCH_2 : batches_done < p1_batches\n(5s later)
P1_BATCH_1 --> P2_BATCH_1 : batches_done = p1_batches\n(5s later)

P1_BATCH_2 : Output: "P1_BATCH_2"
P1_BATCH_2 : Solenoid 0 ON (immediate)
P1_BATCH_2 : Solenoid 0 OFF (3s delay)
P1_BATCH_2 : Display: "Plant 1: 2/{p1_batches}"
P1_BATCH_2 : batches_done = 2

P1_BATCH_2 --> P1_BATCH_3 : More batches needed
P1_BATCH_2 --> P2_BATCH_1 : Done with P1

P1_BATCH_3 : Output: "P1_BATCH_3"
P1_BATCH_3 : Same pattern...
P1_BATCH_3 --> P1_BATCH_4 : If needed
P1_BATCH_3 --> P2_BATCH_1 : Done

P1_BATCH_4 : Output: "P1_BATCH_4"
P1_BATCH_4 : Max batches for long water
P1_BATCH_4 --> P2_BATCH_1

P2_BATCH_1 : Output: "P2_BATCH_1"
P2_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 1 ON (immediate)
P2_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 1 OFF (3s delay)
P2_BATCH_1 : Display: "Plant 2: 1/{p2_batches}"

P2_BATCH_1 --> P2_BATCH_2 : More batches
P2_BATCH_1 --> P3_BATCH_1 : Done or skip

P2_BATCH_2 : Output: "P2_BATCH_2"
P2_BATCH_2 --> P2_BATCH_3 : More batches
P2_BATCH_2 --> P3_BATCH_1 : Done

P2_BATCH_3 : Output: "P2_BATCH_3"
P2_BATCH_3 --> P3_BATCH_1

P3_BATCH_1 : Output: "P3_BATCH_1"
P3_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 2 pattern
P3_BATCH_1 --> P3_BATCH_2 : More
P3_BATCH_1 --> P4_BATCH_1 : Done

P3_BATCH_2 : Output: "P3_BATCH_2"
P3_BATCH_2 --> P4_BATCH_1

P4_BATCH_1 : Output: "P4_BATCH_1"
P4_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 3 pattern
P4_BATCH_1 --> P4_BATCH_2 : More
P4_BATCH_1 --> P5_BATCH_1 : Done

P4_BATCH_2 : Output: "P4_BATCH_2"
P4_BATCH_2 --> P5_BATCH_1

P5_BATCH_1 : Output: "P5_BATCH_1"
P5_BATCH_1 : Solenoid 4 pattern
P5_BATCH_1 --> P5_BATCH_2 : More
P5_BATCH_1 --> COMPLETE : Done

P5_BATCH_2 : Output: "P5_BATCH_2"
P5_BATCH_2 --> COMPLETE

COMPLETE : Output: "COMPLETE"
COMPLETE : Pump OFF (immediate)
COMPLETE : Display: "Complete!"
COMPLETE : NeoPixel: Green
COMPLETE : Log results
COMPLETE --> IDLE : 5s later

EMERGENCY : Output: "EMERGENCY"
EMERGENCY : All solenoids OFF
EMERGENCY : Pump OFF
EMERGENCY : Display: "EMERGENCY"
EMERGENCY : NeoPixel: Red

IDLE -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Manual
P1_BATCH_1 -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Error
P2_BATCH_1 -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Error
P3_BATCH_1 -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Error
P4_BATCH_1 -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Error
P5_BATCH_1 -[#red]-> EMERGENCY : Error
EMERGENCY --> IDLE : Reset

note left of COMPLETE
  Pump Control:
  Separate pump action
  monitors state and:
  - ON during START_SEQUENCE
  - ON during any BATCH state
  - OFF during COMPLETE/IDLE
end note

note bottom
  Action Types:
  
  1. Main State Machine (5s cooldown):
     - Reads state, weather, sensors
     - Publishes solenoid commands
     - Updates state
  
  2. Pump Action (monitors state):
     - If state contains "BATCH" or "SEQUENCE": Pump ON
     - If state = "COMPLETE" or "IDLE": Pump OFF
  
  3. Display Action (monitors state):
     - Updates LCD based on state
     - Dims NeoPixel after midnight
end note

@enduml